      "audioDurationSeconds": 105,
      "whatNotToSay": "It's just a banana! Why are you crying over something so ridiculous?",
      "deliveryTip": "Acknowledge the physical reality of what they see. Validate the loss before offering any physical repair. Keep your voice tender and compassionate."
