      "audioDurationSeconds": 115,
      "whatNotToSay": "You look so skinny and great! How much weight have you lost?",
      "deliveryTip": "Do not debate calories, nutrition, or weight. Consult an adolescent medicine specialist or eating disorder specialized therapist immediately."
