      "audioDurationSeconds": 105,
      "whatNotToSay": "Stop playing with that clay and do your homework! That animation stuff is a waste of time!",
      "deliveryTip": "Protect their flow zones: do not interrupt deep creative work for trivial household tasks. Offer a silent glass of water or snack and let them stay in the zone."
