      "audioDurationSeconds": 115,
      "whatNotToSay": "Well, if you're not having fun anymore, you should just quit and find something else.",
      "deliveryTip": "Share your own adult plateaus (in work, sports, or hobbies). Explain: 'Frustration is not a sign you are failing; it is a sign that neuroplastic learning has begun.'"
