      "audioUrl": "https://assets.alongside.care/academy/audio/teen-deep-work-block.mp3",
      "audioDurationSeconds": 110,
      "whatNotToSay": "You're just lazy and addicted to your phone! You will never survive college like this!",
      "deliveryTip": "Help them install website blockers (like Freedom or Cold Turkey) and establish a dedicated 'Deep Work Chamber' with clean desk surfaces and zero visual clutter."
