      "audioDurationSeconds": 105,
      "whatNotToSay": "Sure, here's $20 to buy whatever mystery boxes you want so you stop bugging me.",
      "deliveryTip": "Educate them transparently about game design: explain how game studios hire behavioral psychologists to extract money from children."
